intro.title=Introduction
intro.description=Take your first steps, and gather what a first camp is built from.
intro.short=Gather rubble, fibre and sticks

skip-intro.title=Skip Intro
skip-intro.description=Already know your way around? Nobody will hold it against you.
skip-intro.short=Use /ojournal or /oquest abandon Intro to skip the tutorial

craft-tools.title=Craft a hatchet and pickaxe
craft-tools.description=Two tools, and the world opens up.
craft-tools.short=Craft a crude hatchet and a crude pickaxe

craft-workbench.title=Craft a workbench
craft-workbench.description=Every camp worth the name has a bench at its heart.
craft-workbench.short=Gather wood and stone, then craft and place a workbench

choose-weapon.title=Choose your weapon
choose-weapon.description=One of the four. The others can wait.
choose-weapon.short=Craft one of the four crude weapons

gather-stick.title=Gather sticks
gather-stick.description=Pick up sticks from the ground and from bushes.

gather-fibre.title=Gather fibre
gather-fibre.description=Pull fibre from the tall grass around you.

gather-rubble.title=Gather stone rubble
gather-rubble.description=Break rocks to collect stone rubble.

craft-hatchet.title=Craft a crude hatchet
craft-hatchet.description=Sticks and stone make an edge good enough for wood.

craft-pickaxe.title=Craft a crude pickaxe
craft-pickaxe.description=The same again, shaped for rock.

break-wood.title=Break some wood
break-wood.description=Use your hatchet to cut trunks.

break-stone.title=Break some stone
break-stone.description=Use your pickaxe to break rocks.

gather-wood.title=Gather wood
gather-wood.description=Four pieces, carried rather than left where they fell.

gather-stone.title=Gather stone
gather-stone.description=Three pieces will do for the bench.

craft-bench.title=Craft the workbench
craft-bench.description=Put the wood and the stone together.

place-bench.title=Put the workbench down
place-bench.description=A bench in your pack is no use to anyone.

craft-sword.title=Craft a crude sword
craft-sword.description=The straightforward answer.

craft-daggers.title=Craft crude daggers
craft-daggers.description=Two blades for whoever would rather be quick.

craft-mace.title=Craft a crude mace
craft-mace.description=Nothing subtle about it.

craft-battleaxe.title=Craft a crude battleaxe
craft-battleaxe.description=Slow, and worth the wait.

defeat-guardian.title=Defeat the Guardian
defeat-guardian.description=The golem has stood watch over the temple for longer than anyone remembers.
defeat-guardian.short=Defeat the crystal golem guarding the Forgotten Temple

enter-forgotten-temple.title=Enter the Forgotten Temple
enter-forgotten-temple.description=Whatever the guardian was protecting is still in there.
enter-forgotten-temple.short=Find your way inside the Forgotten Temple

talk-merchant.title=Talk to the temple merchant
talk-merchant.description=Even in a forgotten temple, someone has found a way to make a living.
talk-merchant.short=Speak with the Kweebec merchant inside the Forgotten Temple
talk-merchant.in-temple=Inside the Forgotten Temple

gather-meat.title=Gather meat
gather-meat.description=Whatever you bring down, carry a cut of it home.
gather-meat.short=Hunt an animal and pick up its meat

craft-campfire.title=Craft a campfire
craft-campfire.description=Raw meat makes no dinner.
craft-campfire.short=Craft a campfire from sticks and rubble

cook-meat.title=Cook your meat
cook-meat.description=The smell alone is worth the wait.
cook-meat.short=Cook raw meat in the campfire and take it back out

eat-meat.title=Eat your meat
eat-meat.description=The fire did its part.
eat-meat.short=Eat the cooked meat

run-novice.title=Find your stride
run-novice.description=Every journey starts on your own two feet.
run-novice.short=Run 100 metres
run-adept.title=Long hauler
run-adept.description=The world is wider than the camp.
run-adept.short=Run 1,000 metres
run-master.title=Tireless
run-master.description=Some say you never stopped.
run-master.short=Run 10,000 metres

sprint-novice.title=Turn of speed
sprint-novice.description=While the breath lasts.
sprint-novice.short=Sprint 50 metres
sprint-adept.title=Fleet footed
sprint-adept.description=Gathered a burst at a time.
sprint-adept.short=Sprint 500 metres
sprint-master.title=Wind runner
sprint-master.description=Nothing catches you now.
sprint-master.short=Sprint 5,000 metres

jump-novice.title=Off the ground
jump-novice.description=For no reason at all.
jump-novice.short=Jump 25 times
jump-adept.title=Sure footed
jump-adept.description=Ledges stopped mattering a while back.
jump-adept.short=Jump 250 times
jump-master.title=Skyward
jump-master.description=Gravity is a suggestion.
jump-master.short=Jump 2,500 times

temple-trial.title=The Temple's trial
temple-trial.description=The temple measures those who enter it. Few are found worthy.
temple-trial.short=Complete the temple's trials within three minutes
temple-trial.in-temple=Stay inside the Forgotten Temple: leaving fails the trial
temple-warmup.title=Sprint-jump at the rune altar
temple-warmup.description=Jump ten times while sprinting, close to the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
temple-warmup.sprinting=While sprinting
temple-warmup.near-altar=Within 12 blocks of the rune altar
temple-offering.title=Offer essence at the rune altar
temple-offering.description=The altar remembers every gift, and who gave it.
temple-offering.short=Drop 10 Essence of Life at the foot of the rune altar
temple-offering.in-temple=Inside the Forgotten Temple
temple-offering.near-altar=Within 6 blocks of the rune altar
temple-race.title=Run to the rune altar
temple-race.description=Reach the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
temple-run.title=Run through the temple for 20 seconds
temple-run.description=Run for 20 seconds, exploring the temple grounds.
temple-hold.title=Explore the temple for a minute
temple-hold.description=Spend at least one minute inside the temple, looking around.

daily-chores.title=Garden chores
daily-chores.description=A garden does not tend itself.
daily-chores.short=Pick berries, gather flowers and open a wooden chest
chores-berries.title=Pick wild berries
chores-berries.description=Pick wild berries from the bushes.
chores-flowers.title=Gather flowers
chores-flowers.description=Pick five flowers to brighten up the house.
chores-chest.title=Open a wooden chest
chores-chest.description=Open a wooden chest to put the harvest away.

great-felling.title=The Great Felling
great-felling.description=One tree is work. Five hundred is a story told for years.
great-felling.short=Fell 500 tree trunks, all of you together

first-blood.title=First blood
first-blood.description=Another player fell by your hand.
first-blood.short=Defeat another player

flawless.title=Flawless
flawless.description=Not a single stumble.
flawless.short=Pass the Temple's trial without ever failing it
flawless-passed.title=Pass the Temple's trial
flawless-never-failed.title=Never fail it

silent-step.title=Silent step
silent-step.description=Not a sound, not a trace.
silent-step.short=Walk 500 metres without running
lumberjack.title=Lumberjack
lumberjack.description=The forest gives, if you ask with an axe.
lumberjack.short=Pick up 20 tree trunks

goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors-floor-1.title=First landing
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors-floor-2.title=Second landing
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors-floor-3.title=Third landing
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors-floor-1.title=First landing
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors-floor-2.title=Second landing
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors-floor-3.title=Third landing
goblin-breach-intruders.title=Through the breach
goblin-breach-intruders.description=Goblins swarm the ruins of this lost settlement.\n\nWhoever opened the breach did not ask them first.
goblin-breach-intruders.short=Kill 10 goblins in the Goblin Breach
goblin-breach-scrap.title=Scrap collector
goblin-breach-scrap.description=Goblins build everything from scrap. Hoard a good pile of it.
goblin-breach-scrap.short=Collect 30 scraps from the goblins of the breach
goblin-breach-fragment.title=A fragment of your own
goblin-breach-fragment.description=Every breach opens on the <color is="#e0b25a">Guttering Hollows</color>, a pocket of the world the goblins call home.\n\nWith a fragment of your own, it opens when you choose.
goblin-breach-fragment.short=Craft a breach fragment at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-skeletons.title=The restless dead
goblin-breach-skeletons.description=Beneath the ruins, the old settlers still walk their crypt. Lay them to rest.
goblin-breach-skeletons.short=Kill 8 skeletons in the crypt of the breach
goblin-breach-knights.title=Knights of the crypt
goblin-breach-knights.description=Armoured knights bar the way to the deepest tombs. Break through.
goblin-breach-knights.short=Kill 3 skeleton knights in the crypt
goblin-breach-revenant.title=The Revenant Guardian
goblin-breach-revenant.description=At the heart of the crypt, a knight of the Void still guards its masters.\n\n<i>Its masters left long ago. Nobody told it.</i>
goblin-breach-revenant.short=Defeat the Revenant Guardian at the heart of the crypt
goblin-breach-rune.title=Rune of fire
goblin-breach-rune.description=The guardian left rune shards behind, still warm to the touch.
goblin-breach-rune.short=Craft a fire rune at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.title=The ruined watchtower
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.description=Skeleton archers hold the old stone watchtowers, and every landing is theirs.
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-floors.short=Climb a stone watchtower floor by floor
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.title=Top of the ruined tower
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.description=From up there, the whole breach lies open, and every goblin in it.
goblin-breach-crypt-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a stone watchtower
goblin-breach-miners.title=Down the mine
goblin-breach-miners.description=Goblins dig ore out of the caves under the ruins. Put an end to their digging.
goblin-breach-miners.short=Kill 5 goblin miners in the mines
goblin-breach-guardians.title=The mine guards
goblin-breach-guardians.description=Shielded guardians keep watch over the deepest galleries. Bring them down.
goblin-breach-guardians.short=Kill 3 goblin guardians in the mines
goblin-breach-glutton.title=The Glutton
goblin-breach-glutton.description=Past the mine, a goblin of enormous appetite rules the slums. Challenge it.
goblin-breach-glutton.short=Defeat the Goblin Glutton in the slums
goblin-breach-lobbers.title=Bomb throwers
goblin-breach-lobbers.description=Lobbers rain bombs on anyone who comes near. Get close and stop them.
goblin-breach-lobbers.short=Kill 4 goblin lobbers
goblin-breach-boom-powder.title=Boom powder
goblin-breach-boom-powder.description=Boomshrooms grow in the damp of the mine, and goblins grind them into something far less peaceful.
goblin-breach-boom-powder.short=Craft 4 boom powder at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-bangstick.title=Bangsticks
goblin-breach-bangstick.description=Turn the powder against its owners.
goblin-breach-bangstick.short=Craft 2 bangsticks at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.title=The goblin watchtower
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.description=Goblin turrets bristle on the scrap watchtowers, one floor above the other.
goblin-breach-mine-tower-floors.short=Climb a goblin watchtower floor by floor
goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.title=Top of the goblin tower
goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.description=Goblins pile their treasures where no one else would bother to climb.
goblin-breach-mine-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a goblin watchtower
goblin-breach-voidtaken.title=The Voidtaken Grizzly
goblin-breach-voidtaken.description=A grizzly twisted by the Void prowls the breach. Hunt it down for its hide.
goblin-breach-voidtaken.short=Hunt down the Voidtaken Grizzly in the breach
goblin-breach-rocket-boots.title=Rocket boots
goblin-breach-rocket-boots.description=Bangsticks, gadgets and voidtaken hide: build boots that leap like an explosion.
goblin-breach-rocket-boots.short=Craft rocket boots at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-glider.title=Scrap glider
goblin-breach-glider.description=The goblins' finest work: a glider of scrap, silk and voidtaken hide to soar off the towers.
goblin-breach-glider.short=Craft a scrap glider at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-spiders.title=Webbed tunnels
goblin-breach-spiders.description=Cave spiders have taken over whole tunnels. Clear their nest.
goblin-breach-spiders.short=Kill 8 cave spiders in the webbed tunnels
goblin-breach-burners.title=Flamethrowers
goblin-breach-burners.description=Goblins with flamethrowers burn their way through the webs. Put out their fire.
goblin-breach-burners.short=Kill 2 goblin burners
goblin-breach-nest.title=Purge the nest
goblin-breach-nest.description=The spiders breed faster than the goblins can burn them. The nest has to go, all at once.
goblin-breach-nest.short=Kill 25 cave spiders in a single trip into the breach
goblin-breach-silk.title=Spider silk
goblin-breach-silk.description=Goblin gadgets need strong thread. Gather silk from the spiders.
goblin-breach-silk.short=Gather 12 spider silk
goblin-breach-scrap-hook.title=A sturdy hook
goblin-breach-scrap-hook.description=Every goblin contraption starts with something sturdy to hang it from.
goblin-breach-scrap-hook.short=Craft a scrap hook at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-hookshot.title=Hookshot
goblin-breach-hookshot.description=Hook, silk and a gadget: build a hookshot to reach the high places.
goblin-breach-hookshot.short=Craft a hookshot at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-void-spawn.title=Creatures of the Void
goblin-breach-void-spawn.description=Larvae, crawlers and worse pour out of the anomalies. Drive them back.
goblin-breach-void-spawn.short=Kill 12 Void creatures in the breach
goblin-breach-anomalies.title=Void anomalies
goblin-breach-anomalies.description=Void crystals tear through the land, humming with something that does not belong here.
goblin-breach-anomalies.short=Shatter 3 Void anomaly crystals
goblin-breach-heart.title=Heart of the anomaly
goblin-breach-heart.description=Deep underground, a huge anomaly feeds on a keystone crystal.
goblin-breach-heart.short=Shatter the keystone crystal of a large underground anomaly
goblin-breach-void-crystals.title=Void crystals
goblin-breach-void-crystals.description=Shattered anomalies leave crystals still humming with the Void. Collect them.
goblin-breach-void-crystals.short=Gather 6 Void crystals
goblin-breach-gadgets.title=Gadget assemblies
goblin-breach-gadgets.description=Scrap and Void crystal make the heart of every goblin gadget.
goblin-breach-gadgets.short=Craft 3 gadget assemblies at the goblin workbench
goblin-breach-void-tower-top.title=The overgrown tower
goblin-breach-void-tower-top.description=The Void has swallowed some watchtowers whole.
goblin-breach-void-tower-top.short=Reach the top of a watchtower overgrown by the Void
goblin-breach-entombed.title=The entombed spawn
goblin-breach-entombed.description=A Void spawn lies sealed in crystal among the large anomalies and outposts.
goblin-breach-entombed.short=Free the Void spawn sealed in crystal, then slay it
goblin-breach-coffer-key.title=A veilbound key
goblin-breach-coffer-key.description=The entombed spawn carried a strange key. Keep it until you find what it opens.
goblin-breach-coffer-key.short=Pick up the veilbound key of the entombed spawn
goblin-breach-coffer.title=The veilbound coffer
goblin-breach-coffer.description=A locked coffer draws every goblin in earshot the moment it opens.
goblin-breach-coffer.short=Open a veilbound coffer and kill 12 goblins defending it
goblin-breach-daily-hunt.title=The day's cull
goblin-breach-daily-hunt.description=The breaches refill as fast as they are emptied.
goblin-breach-daily-hunt.short=Kill 50 goblins in any Goblin Breach
goblin-breach.in-breach=In the Guttering Hollows

